      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَاكِمُ</span></b>  <i>Calamities, misfortunes,</i> or <i>evil accidents.</i> (K.) The Arabs say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَاكِمُ الدَّهْرِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَكَمَتْهُ</span></b> 
[<i>The calamities of fortune smote him;</i> or <i>may
the calamities of fortune smite him</i>]. (S.)

